they need to do the same approaches. I don't treat kids and adults all that differently. I do ladders for them. In fact, they're more passionate sometimes about putting star stickers on their ladder than some of the kids I see. They're like, get your stars out. You ready? You know, because we, I'm working with an adult now with perfectionism.
